     Live Video       Experiment
      + stream           Log      
      

1. Object detection

Detect the things that matter to the experiment:

astronaut/person
experiment box
red box
yellow box
tools
designated locations
possibly hands

2. Pose / hand tracking

You need to determine interactions such as:

hand → red box
hand → yellow box
hand → main box

A practical prototype could use:

YOLO for objects
MediaPipe / similar pose-hand estimation
tracking across frames

